#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Tide_Turns\" title=\"The Tide Turns\">The Tide Turns</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Tet-zik,_The_Enlightened_Change\" title=\"Tet-zik, The Enlightened Change\">Tet-zik, The Enlightened Change</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">While you are centered, this item grants you a bonus depending on your current monk stance.</span></span>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><small>Kos-zik, The Air-Change</small><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">+10 Insight bonus to <a href=\"/page/Jump\" title=\"Jump\">Jump</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><small>Riik-zik, The Fire-Change</small><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">+50 Insight bonus to <a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Healing Amplification</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><small>Thok-zik, The Earth-Change</small><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Reinforced_Fists\" title=\"Reinforced Fists\">Reinforced Fists</a>:</b> This item surrounds your fists with kinetic energy. Your unarmed damage is boosted by one half die.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><small>Sed-zik, The Water-Change</small><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">On unarmed vorpal: helpless paralysis poison (DC 17 fortitude save negates), then 1 to 6 <a href=\"/page/DEX\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DEX\">DEX</a> damage.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Armor_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Bonus\">Armor Bonus +4</a>:</b> This item surrounds the wearer with an invisible but tangible field of force, granting +4 armor bonus to AC, just as though he were wearing armor.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\"> Will Save +4</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\"> Will Save +4</a>:</b> This item gives a +4 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to your Will saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Jidz-Tet%27ka.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Jidz-Tet%27ka.png/420px-Jidz-Tet%27ka.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"316\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Jidz-Tet%27ka.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Jidz-Tet%27ka\" title=\"Item:Epic Jidz-Tet&#39;ka\">Epic Jidz-Tet'ka</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>Thri-kreen runes carved into these chitin bracers read 'The shell of the seeker of enlightenment'.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p>These bracers are often a monk's best friend from level 5 to 20. They augment <a href=\"/page/Monk_enhancements#Elemental_Path_Enhancements\" title=\"Monk enhancements\">elemental monk stances</a> by adding additional effects to the active stance: \n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Wind stance</b>: +10 insight bonus to <a href=\"/page/Jump_(skill)\" title=\"Jump (skill)\">Jump</a></li>\n<li><b>Sun stance</b>: +50 insight bonus to <a href=\"/page/Healing_Amplification\" title=\"Healing Amplification\">Healing Amplification</a></li>\n<li><b>Mountain stance</b>: Unarmed damage increased one die step (same effect as <a href=\"/page/Garments_of_Equilibrium\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Garments of Equilibrium\">Garments of Equilibrium</a> etc, doesn't stack)</li>\n<li><b>Ocean stance</b>: On unarmed confirmed vorpal strikes, delivers a poison that paralyzes the target (DC 17 fortitude save) and inflicts 1d6 Dexterity damage (DC 17 fortitude save, increased 50% if paralysis is successful or if the mob is already helpless). The dexterity damage and paralysis effects are saved against separately.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817212548\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.094 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3660/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30551/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10282/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n125.22%  143.566     54 Template:IO\n100.00%  114.650      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  114.650      1 -total\n 96.77%  110.950      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 42.33%   48.528      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 41.35%   47.404      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.05%   45.920      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 38.81%   44.497      2 Template:InCategory\n 22.29%   25.560     10 Template:Popup\n 14.96%   17.147      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10935-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817212548 and revision id 696586. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
  "wikitext": "{{Named item|Jewelry\n  | name                     = Jidz-Tet'ka\n  | type                     = Bracers\n  | class                    = Jewelry\n  | minlevel                 = 5\n  | slot                     = Wrist\n  | bind                     = {{Bind|BtA|BoA}}\n  | durability               = 100\n  | material                 = Bone\n  | hardness                 = 10\n  | basevalue                = 2020 pp\n  | weight                   = 0.10 lbs\n  | epic                     = no\n  | released                 = Update 4\n  | revamped                 = Update 59\n  | quest                    = The Tide Turns\n  | chest                    = End chest\n  | mythic                   = no\n  | enhancements             = \n* {{MonkEffect|Tet-zik, The Enlightened Change}}\n* {{ArmorBonus|4}}\n* {{Save|W|4}}\n* {{Augment|Green}}\n  | crafting                 = Epic Crafting\n  | craftingupgrade          = Epic Jidz-Tet'ka\n  | description              = Thri-kreen runes carved into these chitin bracers read 'The shell of the seeker of enlightenment'.\n  | pic                      = Bracers Generic Torn.png\n  | picdesc                  = Jidz-Tet'ka.png\n  | tips                     = These bracers are often a monk's best friend from level 5 to 20. They augment [[Monk enhancements#Elemental Path Enhancements|elemental monk stances]] by adding additional effects to the active stance: \n* '''Wind stance''': +10 insight bonus to [[Jump (skill)|Jump]]\n* '''Sun stance''': +50 insight bonus to [[Healing Amplification]]\n* '''Mountain stance''': Unarmed damage increased one die step (same effect as [[Garments of Equilibrium]] etc, doesn't stack)\n* '''Ocean stance''': On unarmed confirmed vorpal strikes, delivers a poison that paralyzes the target (DC 17 fortitude save) and inflicts 1d6 Dexterity damage (DC 17 fortitude save, increased 50% if paralysis is successful or if the mob is already helpless). The dexterity damage and paralysis effects are saved against separately.\n}}",
